    description: "Concept audit 2026-10-21/22 (pinned dev e9215548f6; write-up ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/concept_audit_10212026/concept-audit-vocabulary-since-0923_10222026.md). F4, agent read (two agents independently): 'verify-claims . --io-primitives tools/my-io.yaml' with the file committed in the repo: cli.py:5842 builds it shipped=False -> verify_claims.py:2314 assigns in_repo; ADR-0061 ruling 1 defines a command-line-named file as 'yours' (ruling 4's 'tier names follow location' explains how 'nobody vouched' is detected for an UNNAMED in-repo file; naming opts it in). Text renderer dedups 'yours' against flag paths (verify_claims.py:2825-2826) but not 'in_repo' (:2828-2831). Disclosure only, no verdict change. Fix: tier yours + git state; test with a committed in-repo flag file."  # 8073
